{"id":"e7432b8a48a477c7","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy.md","title":"慢增长层次","display":"df-slow-growing-hierarchy — 慢增长层次","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy","aliases":["72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy"],"display":"df-slow-growing-hierarchy — 慢增长层次","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §2.11, Def.2.16(1); print156–157; PDF168–169","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-against-book","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-slow-growing-hierarchy — 慢增长层次"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §2.11, Def.2.16(1); print156–157; PDF168–169"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-book"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(G:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 由以下良基递归定义，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha(n)=G(\\alpha,n)\">\\(G_\\alpha(n)=G(\\alpha,n)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad G_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq G_\\alpha(n)+1,\\qquad G_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq G_{\\alpha_n}(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad G_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq G_\\alpha(n)+1,\\qquad G_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq G_{\\alpha_n}(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 III 章 §2.11 和 Definition 2.16(1)，印刷 pp.156–157 / PDF pp.168–169。每个递归调用严格下降到子树，输出属于自然数，故由良基递归得到唯一全函数。没有假定层次只依赖外延序数；基本序列属于输入。由前驱集递归还可归纳得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|\">\\(G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|\\)</span>；本次已对 PDF pp.168–169 的定义复核。该等式现由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7\" href=\"?note=c9e7ac8b29af6dc7\" title=\"72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism\">72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism</a> 单独陈述并给出完整归纳证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]；$\\alpha\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：第 III 章 §2.11 和 Definition 2.16(1)，印刷 pp.156–157 / PDF pp.168–169。每个递归调用严格下降到子树，输出属于自然数，故由良基递归得到唯一全函数。没有假定层次只依赖外延序数；基本序列属于输入。由前驱集递归还可归纳得到 $G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|$；本次已对 PDF pp.168–169 的定义复核。该等式现由 [[72-thm-slow-growing-arithmetic-homomorphism]] 单独陈述并给出完整归纳证明。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\Omega\\times\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha(n)=G(\\alpha,n)","display":false},{"tex":"G_{\\mathbf0}(n)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad G_{\\mathsf S\\alpha}(n)\\coloneqq G_\\alpha(n)+1,\\qquad G_{\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_{i\\in\\omega})}(n)\\coloneqq G_{\\alpha_n}(n).","display":true},{"tex":"G_\\alpha(n)=|\\alpha[n]|","display":false}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy|df-slow-growing-hierarchy — 慢增长层次]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy|df-slow-growing-hierarchy — 慢增长层次]]"},{"id":"f6e6568ea7b179d6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G,H,B,F$ 分别见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]、[[72-df-fast-growing-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G$ 见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]；$\\alpha[n]$ 及有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。"}],"outgoing":["2e4aa3df9477aa6f","c9e7ac8b29af6dc7"]}